OL,3,ATrump says every adult American will
OL,4,Aget $5,000 if Republicans win midterms
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe gave no details on how it would work
OL,7,For be funded ` saying only that the
OL,8,Fmoney would have to be spent in the US.
OL,9,FVice-President JD Vance has linked the
OL,10,Fplan to the revenue that Trump has
OL,11,Fraised from US tariffs on imported
OL,12,Fgoods.
OL,14,FDemocrats labelled it an "empty
OL,15,Fpromise" and others questioned whether
OL,16,Fsuch a pledge was legal or feasible.
